OL,3,ARare turtles found inside baggage at   
OL,4,AAmsterdam airport                      
OL,6,FThe endangered species, thought to be  
OL,7,Fthe smallest freshwater turtles in the 
OL,8,Fworld with a maximum length of about   
OL,9,F10cm (4in), were wrapped in duct tape  
OL,10,Fto prevent them from moving.           
OL,12,FThe NVWA said they were "presumably    
OL,13,Fstolen" from the wild in their native  
OL,14,FMexico.                                
